{"id":"7a4bd3fabba2bd0f","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-redex-contraction-well-defined.md","title":"收缩的单值性与一步关系对应","display":"thm-redex-contraction-well-defined — 收缩的单值性与一步关系对应","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-redex-contraction-well-defined","aliases":["56-thm-redex-contraction-well-defined"],"display":"thm-redex-contraction-well-defined — 收缩的单值性与一步关系对应","depends_on":["[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]"],"source_section":"§2.2 Definition 2.2.4; §4.2 Remark 4.2.4","source_printed_pages":"35,95","source_ocr_blocks":[56,116],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; occurrence-coding-local","source_proof_status":"scope-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-redex-contraction-well-defined"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-redex-contraction-well-defined</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-redex-contraction-well-defined — 收缩的单值性与一步关系对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.2 Definition 2.2.4; §4.2 Remark 4.2.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"35,95"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56</span><span>116</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; occurrence-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"scope-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,T,R,S,\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\operatorname{ctr}_R,\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(\\Sigma,V,T,R,S,\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\operatorname{ctr}_R,\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>；一步关系与红项位置的对应式独立取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>；匹配及收缩唯一性两个断言局部另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=(p,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(u=(p,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in S\\;\\bigl(s|_p=l\\sigma=l\\tau\\Rightarrow r\\sigma=r\\tau\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in S\\;\\bigl(s|_p=l\\sigma=l\\tau\\Rightarrow r\\sigma=r\\tau\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!t\\in T\\;((s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!t\\in T\\;((s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_R t\\iff\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;((s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_R t\\iff\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;((s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(s)=\\{\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\mid u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(s)=\\{\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\mid u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：自由项构造器单射，结构归纳给出lσ=lτ时σ、τ在Var(l)上相同；Var(r)包含于Var(l)，再归纳得到rσ=rτ。剩余三个式子逐项展开红项图及原有一步关系。源项和目标项相同也不能省略具体步身份，例如规则a→a收缩了旧红项，所得a是新的出现。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的Terese (2003)本地DjVu，原文件与上轮提取的规范化文字哈希本轮重新核对一致；OCR块按U+001F分段从1编号，不等于物理扫描页。未取得PDF页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-redex-occurrence","status":"resolved","id":"707725c5abd5d9ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-redex-occurrence","status":"resolved","id":"707725c5abd5d9ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,T,R,S,\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\operatorname{ctr}_R,\\operatorname{Step}_R$。$\\to_R$ 及 $\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]；一步关系与红项位置的对应式独立取 $s,t\\in T$；匹配及收缩唯一性两个断言局部另取 $u=(p,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,T,R,S,\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\operatorname{ctr}_R,\\operatorname{Step}_R$。$\\to_R$ 及 $\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R$ 见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]；一步关系与红项位置的对应式独立取 $s,t\\in T$；匹配及收缩唯一性两个断言局部另取 $u=(p,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,V,T,R,S,\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\operatorname{ctr}_R,\\operatorname{Step}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"u=(p,l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in S\\;\\bigl(s|_p=l\\sigma=l\\tau\\Rightarrow r\\sigma=r\\tau\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists!t\\in T\\;((s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R).","display":true},{"tex":"s\\to_R t\\iff\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;((s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R(s)=\\{\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\mid u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1958,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-redex-contraction-well-defined.md]]"}],"outgoing":["707725c5abd5d9ca","a3b60e1e9cdeef27"]}